  "reasoning": "The appellant repeatedly stole electric cables from construction sites, which are public telecom/electric facilities, and sold them as scrap. This constitutes theft (盗窃) and also the destruction of public telecom facilities (破坏广播电视设施、公用电信设施). The later act of taking a court‑seized vehicle is also a form of theft, already covered by the theft charge. No other distinct offenses from the provided label list apply.",
  "final_answer": "盗窃;破坏广播电视设施、公用电信设施"
}
